{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：10:01 2026-11-03 HKT<br/>發佈時間：10:01 2026-11-03 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：10:01 2026-11-03 HKT</p><img alt=\"運輸署宣布咪錶泊車系統出現故障，現正緊急搶修。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/a8412e1e2310c8c4d94ac1bee32a0238/2026-11/KakaoTalk_20251013_161437464_03.jpg\"/><p>運輸署今日（3日）上午約8時20分，接獲營運商報告咪錶泊車系統出現故障，現正緊急搶修。署方已責成營運商從速跟進及完成所需修復工作，將對駕駛人士的影響減至最低，並徹查事故原因及提交報告。如有查詢，駕駛人士可致電服務熱線2332 3700。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T02:22:02.077990+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":201,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T02:01:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T02:19:11.242517+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T02:19:11.242517+00:00","content_hash":"46ebeecc6f6f7ed2824e439120fa669ed791e99d87fbd4bb6e9dcb29dc665d1f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}